  "Description": "Farms Silver Stake from ShadowSlayer in shadowslayerwar for Hunter's Reward merge shop. Completes quests 10908 (5x Wulpurga Medal) and 10909 (3x Mega Wulpurga Medal). Stops at 1000 Silver Stakes (max stack).",
